@guide H_51_Felwood
@name Felwood (54)
@faction Horde
@levels 54-54
@zone Felwood
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Felwood, visit 1 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 54.
@next H_52_Winterspring

travel Felwood
train
accept 8460 Timbermaw Ally | Grazle, near the Timbermaw Hold tunnel.
turnin 8460 Timbermaw Ally
accept 5155 Forces of Jaedenar | Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary.
accept 5156 Verifying the Corruption | Taronn Redfeather.
accept 4505 Well of Corruption | Winna Hazzard, Bloodvenom Post.
accept 5202 A Strange Red Key
accept 6162 A Husband's Last Battle
turnin 5202 A Strange Red Key
note The next quest, Rescue From Jaedenar, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 5203 Rescue From Jaedenar
complete 5203 Rescue From Jaedenar | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete 4505 Well of Corruption | Fill the flask at the Irontree moonwell.
complete 5155 Forces of Jaedenar | Jaedenar cultists.
complete 5156 Verifying the Corruption | Explore north of Shatter Scar Vale.
turnin 4505 Well of Corruption
accept 4506 Corrupted Sabers
complete 4506 Corrupted Sabers | Use the cage on a corrupted saber.
turnin 4506 Corrupted Sabers
complete 6162 A Husband's Last Battle
turnin 6162 A Husband's Last Battle
turnin 5155 Forces of Jaedenar
turnin 5203 Rescue From Jaedenar
accept 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water
complete 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water | The corrupted moonwell in Jaedenar.
turnin 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water
turnin 5156 Verifying the Corruption
accept 8461 Deadwood of the North | Nafien.
accept 5083 Winterfall Firewater
complete 8461 Deadwood of the North | Deadwood furbolgs.
turnin 8461 Deadwood of the North
accept 8465 Speak to Salfa | Nafien. Turned in at the Winterspring end of the Timbermaw tunnel.
level 54 | Winterspring starts at 54. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
